Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.43,0:00:02.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光明与黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.53,0:00:04.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在陷入一片混乱的战国时代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.34,0:00:06.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了四魂之玉因缘际会聚在一起的伙伴们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.68,0:00:08.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿越五百年的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:12.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在最后仅存的四魂之玉碎片引导着各自的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.58,0:00:13.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战国时代的传奇故事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.98,0:00:14.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.55,0:00:17.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传说中的妖马 炎蹄
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:20.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据说只要骑上它的人可以取得天下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.19,0:00:21.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在它被解开了封印
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.09,0:00:24.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且它的背后有着奈落的分身婴儿跟神乐的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:29.29,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can now dream （勇敢的梦想） 挥起舞动{\fad(300,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.43,0:00:36.23,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in a world （暧昧的世界） 奋力冲出吧{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.82,0:00:49.41,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,面对忧郁的现实生活{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.79,0:00:55.62,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不断在心中自我成长的勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.79,0:01:01.82,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨夜的梦境及梦中残留的影像{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.80,0:01:06.76,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,断断续续提醒我「勇往直前」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.07,0:01:14.60,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,破茧而出的我及含苞待放的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.71,0:01:19.34,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你就将它禁锢起来吗{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.82,0:01:23.68,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can now dream （勇敢的梦想） 挥起舞动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.85,0:01:28.18,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Go and try （不顾一切的去尝试） 无尽的烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.36,0:01:32.69,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与你天长地久永不分离
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.86,0:01:35.66,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Do you need to cry （同样的哭泣） 和孤独相伴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.80,0:01:40.23,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Show me a day fight （直接应战） 每当伤心流泪的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.37,0:01:47.24,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让它成为坚定不移的梦想吧{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.79,0:02:33.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是心理作用吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.36,0:02:37.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.13,0:02:45.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你究竟是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.20,0:02:50.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我安份点 马上就会结束的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.84,0:02:56.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风刃之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.20,0:03:26.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第141话 被释放的妖马炎蹄
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.68,0:03:37.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肚子好饿喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.62,0:03:41.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才不是才吃过鱼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.32,0:03:43.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是又没有吃到饭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.19,0:03:45.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.49,0:03:46.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.63,0:03:48.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不介意的话 就交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.76,0:03:51.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你带着什么吃的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.33,0:03:53.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我是没有带什么啦 不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:03:55.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看那边
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.87,0:03:57.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是村子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.07,0:03:59.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是村子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.34,0:04:02.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.28,0:04:05.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 那就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.78,0:04:06.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.72,0:04:09.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有饭吃了 吃饭 吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.02,0:04:15.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总觉得有点不对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.29,0:04:16.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个村子…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.09,0:04:21.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神官大人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.60,0:04:24.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 神官大人被杀害了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.87,0:04:25.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.10,0:04:27.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是指最近频传的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.23,0:04:30.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,专门杀害那些道行高深的神官和僧人这件事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.47,0:04:33.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不知道到底是什么人干的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.31,0:04:36.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过一直发展到现在 事情绝不寻常
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.54,0:04:39.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也因为这样 被封印在神社里的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.98,0:04:42.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每到晚上就出来作乱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.68,0:04:43.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.42,0:04:46.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以村子才这么荒凉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.00,0:04:59.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 怎么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.43,0:05:00.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你感觉到什么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.84,0:05:02.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.21,0:05:14.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有气味 虽然只是杂碎妖怪的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.95,0:05:16.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且藏了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.02,0:05:19.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.02,0:05:21.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家可别大意
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.59,0:05:25.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.29,0:05:27.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交给我 我一招就把他们通通解决
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.96,0:05:32.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.04,0:05:44.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要开动咯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.12,0:05:49.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.75,0:05:50.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.88,0:05:55.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像这样的事情在这附近经常发生是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.26,0:05:58.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 到处都是这样的传闻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.19,0:05:59.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛抢我的 还我…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.76,0:06:03.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高僧和神官接二连三地遭到杀害
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.76,0:06:05.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底会是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.00,0:06:08.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.64,0:06:13.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凶手好像是一个抱着婴儿的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.01,0:06:16.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说 难道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.98,0:06:19.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,婴儿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.01,0:06:22.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.78,0:06:25.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听这么说 那个女人想必是神乐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.29,0:06:26.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.72,0:06:29.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到了这个时候还以人类为目标
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.22,0:06:31.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们到底想要干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.59,0:06:33.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种事情怎么样都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.93,0:06:36.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正如果这件事跟奈落那个家伙扯上关系的话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.93,0:06:38.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就不能袖手旁观
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:39.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.43,0:06:43.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确是 这样没错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.60,0:06:46.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 现在神乐在哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.44,0:06:48.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个倒不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.01,0:06:53.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这附近最有名气的僧人或神官是哪一位呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.95,0:06:56.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是问还在世的高僧吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.32,0:06:58.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还用问吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.39,0:07:02.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.82,0:07:05.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这附近还活着的高僧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.76,0:07:07.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说起来最有名的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.53,0:07:11.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是万愿寺的神泉和尚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.70,0:07:13.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神泉和尚？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.53,0:07:16.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是指那位神泉和尚吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.34,0:07:17.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听过他的名字吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.07,0:07:20.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 是一位很有名的僧人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.07,0:07:25.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据说论起封印妖怪的功力 无人能及...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.41,0:07:28.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连身为驱魔师的我也听说过
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.05,0:07:31.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确是非常有名
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.42,0:07:35.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是封印了那个人称炼狱鬼的食人妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.59,0:07:39.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以及他骑的妖马“炎蹄”这个传说是最为有名的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.87,0:07:55.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问您怎么了吗 神泉师父
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.81,0:07:59.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么…可能是我多疑了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.75,0:08:03.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像感觉到炎蹄在嘶鸣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.18,0:08:04.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炎蹄？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.09,0:08:09.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是封印在我们后山祠堂的妖马
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.09,0:08:15.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炎蹄正如其名是一匹有着火焰马蹄的马妖
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.20,0:08:20.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同时也是传说中能够日行千里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.83,0:08:22.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脚力非凡的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.30,0:08:24.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.24,0:08:25.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.47,0:08:26.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根据传说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.47,0:08:30.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相隔百年前有一匹神马被卷入大火之中死去的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.44,0:08:33.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它的怨灵出现在这个世上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.21,0:08:37.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且随着火山爆发转生成为炎蹄
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.35,0:08:41.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总而言之 都还不清楚咯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.46,0:08:44.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也可以这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.49,0:08:48.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过传说还不只是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.00,0:08:52.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于炎蹄还有另外一个传说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.00,0:08:55.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骑上炎蹄的话 就能够取得天下？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.40,0:08:59.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不知道是什么人传开的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.41,0:09:01.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是这种说法广为流传
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.64,0:09:06.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然这种说法只不过是一种迷信罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.38,0:09:08.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是为了炎蹄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.28,0:09:11.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类跟妖怪之间的争斗却没有停止过
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.92,0:09:15.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,经过了跟人类与妖怪无数次的战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.66,0:09:19.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到最后生存下来的炼狱鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.03,0:09:22.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炎蹄给予他骑上它的权利
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.00,0:09:31.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是得到了炎蹄的炼狱鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.67,0:09:33.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变得气势逼人狂暴无比
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.28,0:09:40.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为炼狱鬼的四处作乱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.41,0:09:43.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而让村民们感到痛苦不堪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.28,0:09:47.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是拜托了神泉和尚为他们驱魔除妖
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.66,0:09:56.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时我跟炼狱鬼的战斗 持续了三天三夜的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.66,0:10:02.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且为了要封印炎蹄 耗个三天三夜也是必要的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.70,0:10:30.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.06,0:10:33.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好不容易打败了这两个妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.33,0:10:36.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且分别封印在两个不同的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.44,0:10:40.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个祠堂也就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.07,0:10:42.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.31,0:10:44.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在说起来 已经是很久以前的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.45,0:10:48.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.08,0:10:52.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神泉和尚能够打败如此厉害妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.99,0:10:55.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一位非常了不起的高僧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.62,0:10:58.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然只是预感…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.16,0:11:01.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过既然是能够封印那种妖怪的和尚的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.46,0:11:04.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐会盯上他也没什么好奇怪的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.26,0:11:07.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 既然如此我们快点出发
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.37,0:11:09.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没时间在这里磨蹭下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.65,0:11:20.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？快点去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.75,0:11:23.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了啦 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.78,0:11:25.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爱使唤别人的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.62,0:11:30.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神泉师父
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.12,0:11:32.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么地方不对劲吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.86,0:11:34.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都没有感觉到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.00,0:11:38.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这座寺庙的附近有邪气正在逼近当中
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.37,0:11:41.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们快点去躲起来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.54,0:11:42.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.07,0:11:46.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.31,0:11:48.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟之前的那些家伙比起来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.88,0:11:50.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好像稍微厉害了一点嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.21,0:11:53.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现身吧 妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.29,0:12:00.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自以为是的布下结界了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.32,0:12:05.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说杀害高僧的妖怪是个抱着婴儿的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.69,0:12:10.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你们杀害了那些僧人跟神官的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.43,0:12:14.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是这个婴儿…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.47,0:12:18.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起那个女人恐怕还要厉害数倍
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.91,0:12:22.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许这和尚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.21,0:12:25.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以让我窥视到此世与彼世的交界处吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.41,0:12:27.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.95,0:12:29.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们快退下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.82,0:12:32.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和尚 下一招你还避得开吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.12,0:12:34.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风刃之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.22,0:12:35.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.59,0:12:40.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有两下子嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.60,0:12:47.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么这一招又如何
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:48.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙蛇之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.24,0:12:54.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神泉师父
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.71,0:12:55.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.48,0:12:57.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没用的 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.08,0:12:59.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.37,0:13:25.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神泉师父
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.02,0:13:37.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我好好地来窥视你的心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.90,0:13:53.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成…功了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.14,0:13:58.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…毕竟也老了…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.51,0:14:02.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神泉师父
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.18,0:14:10.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下子…恐怕不妙了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.19,0:14:13.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有血的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.29,0:14:15.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还很新鲜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.22,0:14:18.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再加上有香的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.19,0:14:19.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出事的地点恐怕是寺庙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.57,0:14:28.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.54,0:14:31.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们并不是坏人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.97,0:14:33.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.37,0:14:35.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是神乐下的手吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.94,0:14:38.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里还留有那家伙的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.21,0:14:42.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下手的是一个抱着婴儿的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.98,0:14:45.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有说错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.72,0:14:46.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.82,0:14:49.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,师父很勇敢地跟那个妖怪战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.49,0:14:51.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不惜为了保护我们两个人的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.73,0:14:54.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好不容易把两个妖怪其中一个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.49,0:14:57.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个婴儿成功地消灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.33,0:15:01.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙被…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:05.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.34,0:15:06.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会错的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.84,0:15:09.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,师父的法力将他劈成两半
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.88,0:15:12.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得呢 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.51,0:15:14.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个婴儿…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.08,0:15:18.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是奈落在白灵山之中再次诞生出来的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.39,0:15:22.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且在白灵山崩塌的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.42,0:15:24.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还特地带那个婴儿逃了出来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.72,0:15:28.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对奈落来说 他应该是相当重要的存在对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.86,0:15:29.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.50,0:15:33.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊 总觉得没这么简单
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.40,0:15:37.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.37,0:15:42.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最猛胜…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.55,0:15:48.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想带我去什么地方啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.65,0:15:50.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神无
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.82,0:15:55.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是奈落派你来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.53,0:16:03.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.46,0:16:07.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难不成你是代替奈落来教训我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.07,0:16:14.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.14,0:16:15.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.18,0:16:19.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个由神乐来保护
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.95,0:16:24.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正迟早有一天会变成这个样子…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.36,0:16:33.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,窥视此世与彼世的交界处？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.13,0:16:34.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.33,0:16:39.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在杀了师父之前 那个婴儿就是这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.50,0:16:41.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说什么窥视心灵…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.44,0:16:43.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.74,0:16:48.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐和婴儿到处杀害神官和高僧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.34,0:16:52.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来觉得是为了把被封印住的妖怪们给解放出来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.68,0:16:56.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来似乎没那么简单
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.38,0:16:59.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此世与彼世的交界处
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.95,0:17:01.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是有什么东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.13,0:17:06.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个声音是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.43,0:17:09.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难不成是那个妖怪的封印吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.40,0:17:10.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么封印
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.70,0:17:11.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.67,0:17:14.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在后山是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.60,0:17:15.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.57,0:17:17.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们师父好不容易用他的法力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.14,0:17:19.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,封印住的一匹叫做炎蹄的妖马
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.87,0:17:20.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炎蹄
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.97,0:17:21.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的炎蹄
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.91,0:17:24.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个叫炼狱鬼所骑的那匹妖马吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.08,0:17:26.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.68,0:17:28.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.35,0:17:35.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.72,0:17:56.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.45,0:17:58.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炎蹄
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.16,0:18:06.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你少得意了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.06,0:18:10.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.73,0:18:14.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.64,0:18:16.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 你们也没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.20,0:18:19.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都不要紧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.51,0:18:22.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倒是犬夜叉 那匹妖马…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.71,0:18:26.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.71,0:18:28.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要好好跟它算个帐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.15,0:18:31.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招吧 风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.49,0:18:35.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,避开了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.42,0:18:36.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,速度好快
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.92,0:18:38.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往这里来了 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.43,0:18:40.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:46.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.00,0:18:49.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.80,0:18:51.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.47,0:18:53.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.84,0:18:54.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在上面
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.98,0:19:04.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.95,0:19:05.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.72,0:19:08.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 既然如此我就用风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.96,0:19:09.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.36,0:19:13.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瘴气
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.06,0:19:16.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 那匹马冲来冲去的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.70,0:19:19.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要太得意了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.04,0:19:26.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.34,0:19:31.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要紧吧 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.81,0:19:35.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先别管我 一定要想办法阻止那个家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.38,0:19:39.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 速度太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.29,0:19:41.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样根本就瞄不准
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.82,0:19:44.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不快点阻止那匹妖马的行动的话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.16,0:19:47.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它停止移动了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.46,0:19:49.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.50,0:19:52.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么一来你就死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.83,0:19:54.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.80,0:19:56.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种时候干嘛阻止我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.47,0:19:57.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况不太对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.07,0:19:59.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.68,0:20:13.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好了 大家快跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.15,0:20:49.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作一点 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.96,0:20:50.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.59,0:20:52.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.40,0:20:56.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该还好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.86,0:20:58.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为死定了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.63,0:21:02.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让它跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.30,0:21:05.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它一定是想要去找被封印的主人炼狱鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.47,0:21:08.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们快点追吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.25,0:21:22.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.12,0:21:26.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只剩下一半 是要我怎么处理啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.99,0:21:28.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点气息都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.63,0:21:35.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像动了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.14,0:21:43.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你复活了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.85,0:21:49.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活过来了…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.66,0:22:02.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.30,0:22:24.67,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如今内心充满着悲伤的话{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.29,0:22:40.72,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管靠着我哭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.72,0:22:46.85,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}I get   I get   I get   get the feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.86,0:22:50.38,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}I get   I get   I get   get the dreaming
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.34,0:22:56.37,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像现在这样{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.75,0:23:06.56,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Come my way  这点黑暗之尘
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.73,0:23:14.63,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Come close to me  现在灯已照亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.73,0:23:17.81,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}I'll be with you  I'll be with you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.27,0:23:22.50,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是简简单单的陪在你身边
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.50,0:23:28.95,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}So Come my way{\fad(0,600)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.38,0:23:52.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说是你解开妖马封印的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.61,0:23:55.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炎蹄选择了个看似不祥的孩子骑在自己的背上
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.58,0:23:56.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是白童子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.92,0:23:59.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们应该知道我也是奈落的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.45,0:24:02.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要窥视彼世与此世的交界处
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.32,0:24:03.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里有什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.79,0:24:05.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我唯一能看到的是白茫茫的雾世界
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.06,0:24:07.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要不要也找找看
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.59,0:24:08.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是四魂之玉的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.76,0:24:11.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.26,0:24:13.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狂暴的炎蹄与战栗的白童子
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.13,0:24:15.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.13,0:24:16.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把那么重要的事告诉他们
